    "profile": "At 180 Degrees Consulting, led the architecture for a product-startup client's hierarchical agent workflows (PostgreSQL for persistent storage and retrieval across agent sessions), demoed it live (5-star rating from senior leadership) and contributed to the client's production TypeScript/Node.js MCP server (OpenAI-based query generation), now in live use. Uses Claude Code, Cursor and Codex daily. Production LLM agent work on an AstraZeneca-affiliated multi-omics research platform. Owns data workflows end-to-end in Python and SQL, from merging structured, API and web-scraped data through feature creation, tuning, validation and deployment (Docker, GitHub Actions CI/CD, MLflow, AWS Lambda).",
    "skills": {
