      "Software Engineering & Integrations": "TypeScript/Node.js, React, Python, JavaScript, FastAPI, Pydantic, RESTful APIs and third-party API integrations, GraphQL, PostgreSQL, SQL, MongoDB and DynamoDB (NoSQL), graph data (networkx), pytest, Git (pull requests, code review), debugging and root-cause analysis",
      "Cloud & Deployment": "AWS (Bedrock, Lambda, ECR, S3, SQS, EC2, IAM, Cognito), GCP (Cloud Run), Docker, Kubernetes (AWS EKS), GitHub Actions CI/CD, serverless deployment"
